<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0649_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? Wassup? Wassup? Wassup?\n...I think the connection trash.\rTry again from another spot?\nMy voice deserve better reception.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nice to hear from you.\nHow everythin’ with you?\fI’m good. Obviously. I’m ME.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a lotta stronger Block Bosses\nthan me...\fAllegedly.\fSo get tough or go home!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s your point?\nIf you wanna scrap me again, fine.\fFriday nights, take it or leave it.\rCall me then... Maybe I’ll answer...\nMaybe I’ll let it ring. For drama.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, WELL, you called at the right\ntime! You wanna scrap again?\rI’m down. Obviously. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ha ha ha.\nGreat that you steppin’ up.\rI’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo!\nI’ll be the one with the spotlight.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What in the WORLD?\nYou tryna CLOWN me?!\fNobody says no to Clair!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You figure you wanna scrap me?\rI’m wonderin’ if you got enough time\nto do me justice.\rI hear you made plans with other\npeople. Respect those first.\fThen come worship me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo...\fDon’t punk out.\fI got my good outfit on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yes, it’s Clair here...\nOh, hi. How you doin’?\fDon’t answer. I’ll talk.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Keep in mind we meetin’ at the Saffron\nDojo.\fIt’s a promise I’m waitin’ to keep...\fIn a VERY nice outfit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lately some people from the Radio\nStation came around, wantin’ to do\fa piece on me.\rMy fans DEFINITELY won’t wanna miss\nthat!\rOh, NO! It’s RADIO!\nAll them people won’t SEE my\fGLORIOUS face!\rWhere’s the TV crew?!\nWhy ain’t NO TV crew come for ME?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lately there’s gossip goin’ around\ntown that I’m the latest name in\ffashion.\rWell, if I’m so fly people can’t stop\ntalkin’ about me...\fI totally understand. I’d talk too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0649_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you seem like a pretty busy\nperson, huh? Almost as busy as ME.\rI got Block work, AND I gotta see the\nElder at the Drama Queen shrine.\rWhat you think? You got talent--\nyou could be a Drama Queen too.\fNot as good as me. But close.</language>
	</row>
</body>
